sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant UI as React Voice Agent UI
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant MEM as Memory & CRM (SQLite)
    participant RAG as FAISS + MiniLM RAG
    participant LLM as Docker Ollama (qwen2.5:3b)
    participant BOOK as Appointment Engine (IST)

    Customer->>UI: Speaks or types message (EN / HI)
    UI->>UI: Browser SpeechRecognition (or Text Fallback)
    UI->>API: POST /api/chat (session_id, message, language)
    API->>MEM: Load session history + persisted facts
    API->>MEM: Extract entities, analyze sentiment & compute 100-pt score
    API->>BOOK: Check slot intent / availability / explicit confirmation
    alt Slot Explicitly Confirmed & Free
        BOOK->>MEM: Insert Confirmed Appointment (APT-...)
    end
    API->>RAG: Semantic top-K search over uploaded & sample docs
    RAG-->>API: Relevant snippets + source filenames
    API->>LLM: Grounded prompt + sliding window + RAG + booking state
    LLM-->>API: Natural sales response
    API->>MEM: Persist assistant turn & structured call summary
    API-->>UI: Reply, RAG sources, live Lead Score, Sentiment & Booking
    UI->>Customer: Browser SpeechSynthesis playback + CRM Intelligence update
